<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Poe (Platform for Open Exploration) is Quora's innovative AI platform that gives you access to multiple AI models in one place. Instead of subscribing to ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini separately, Poe offers all of them (and more) under a single subscription.</p>
<p>What makes Poe unique is its marketplace approach to AI. Beyond the major models like GPT-4 and Claude, Poe hosts millions of custom bots created by users. You can also create and share your own specialized AI assistants, potentially earning money from their usage.</p>
<p>For users who want to compare different AI models or need access to multiple AIs for different tasks, Poe offers unmatched convenience and value. It's essentially the "Spotify of AI" - one subscription, many models.</p>
<h2 id="models">Available AI Models</h2>
<div class="model-grid">
<div class="model-card">
<div class="model-card-logo" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981, #059669);">GPT</div>
<h5>GPT-4 / GPT-4o</h5>
<p>OpenAI's flagship models</p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<div class="model-card-logo" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D97706, #B45309);">C</div>
<h5>Claude 3.5 Sonnet</h5>
<p>Anthropic's best model</p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<div class="model-card-logo" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4285F4, #34A853);">G</div>
<h5>Gemini Pro</h5>
<p>Google's AI model</p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<div class="model-card-logo" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #333);">Ll</div>
<h5>Llama 3</h5>
<p>Meta's open model</p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<div class="model-card-logo" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EC4899, #BE185D);">SD</div>
<h5>DALL-E / Stable Diffusion</h5>
<p>Image generation</p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<div class="model-card-logo" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6, #7C3AED);">+</div>
<h5>Custom Bots</h5>
<p>1M+ community bots</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="10" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="1"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="15" r="1"></circle><path d="M9 7L9 9M15 7L15 9M12 2v5"></path></svg></div>
<h4>Multiple AI Models</h4>
<p>Access GPT-4, Claude, Gemini, Llama, and more all in one platform with one subscription.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg></div>
<h4>Custom Bot Creation</h4>
<p>Create your own AI bots with custom prompts, knowledge bases, and personalities. Share or monetize them.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">🏪</div>
<h4>Bot Marketplace</h4>
<p>Explore millions of community-created bots for specific tasks - coding, writing, roleplay, tutoring, and more.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="1" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6"></path></svg></div>
<h4>Creator Monetization</h4>
<p>Earn money when users interact with your bots. Poe shares revenue with successful bot creators.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"/><path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10M1 14l4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 0 20.49 15"/></svg></div>
<h4>Model Switching</h4>
<p>Switch between models mid-conversation. Compare responses from different AIs on the same prompt.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="20" rx="2" ry="2" width="14" x="5" y="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></div>
<h4>Mobile Apps</h4>
<p>Native iOS and Android apps with full functionality. Great mobile AI experience.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Advantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Access multiple AI models in one place</li>
<li>One subscription for GPT-4, Claude, etc.</li>
<li>Create and share custom bots</li>
<li>Huge marketplace of community bots</li>
<li>Earn money as a bot creator</li>
<li>Good free tier available</li>
<li>Easy model comparison</li>
<li>Great mobile apps</li>
<li>API access for developers</li>
<li>First access to new models</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg> Disadvantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Usage limits per model</li>
<li>Less polished than native apps</li>
<li>Can be confusing for beginners</li>
<li>No web search built-in</li>
<li>Quality varies in custom bots</li>
<li>Limited advanced features</li>
<li>Points system can be complex</li>
<li>Some models have daily limits</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
